A '''Butler''' (Japanese: '''しつじ''' ''Butler'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VI]]. They are depicted as well-dressed men employed as servants to other people. They appear to be the male counterpart of {{tc|Maid}}s. The only Butler outside of the [[Battle Maison]] who can be battled is [[Chalmers]], who appears during Chapter 5 of the [[Looker Bureau]]. Butlers also appear in the [[Battle Chateau]], though named as a {{tc|Baron}}, {{tc|Viscount}}, {{tc|Earl}}, {{tc|Marquis}}, or {{tc|Duke}}.

