==In animation==
[[File:Turner.png|thumb|250px|Turner, a Butler from {{aniseries|XY}}]]
===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|XY}}====
A Butler named [[Turner]] appeared in ''[[XY020|Breaking Titles at the Chateau!]]'', alongside a {{tc|Maid}}. They acted as {{Ash}} and {{ashfr|company}}'s guides through the [[Battle Chateau]], and officiated the matches held in the facility. He has the same character design as that of the Butlers in {{g|X and Y}}.

===Pokémon Generations===
The ghost of a Butler appeared in ''[[PG10|The Old Chateau]]'', where he invited [[Cheryl]] to stay for the night at the [[Old Chateau]]. After treating her to a "meal", he escorted her to her room before sinking into the floor.

